## 4. Completed Research & Assessments

### 4.1 Standard Assessment

| **Standard** | **Status** | **Key Findings** |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Equitable Earth** | Completed | M002 methodology suitable for AUDD projects; DRC risk maps already available; 9–12 month certification timeline; €15,000 preliminary fee; three non-negotiable pillars (carbon, livelihoods, ecological condition) |
| **Verra** | In Progress | VM0048 methodology suitable; **critical bottleneck**: Itombwe/South Kivu risk maps not yet published by Verra; VCS v5.0 transition deadline 1 January 2027 |
| **ICVCM / CCP** | Researched | Equitable Earth is an accepted standard for coalitions involving Microsoft, Google, Meta, Salesforce, and Netflix |

### 4.2 Legal & Regulatory Research

